From: Claude Force One <claude@zbfc.one>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:24:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(checks): count hand-written markup of design system
 components

DesignSystemAdoptionCheck reads the class lists in Twig templates. It counts each class list that writes the root class of a component by hand. A component that is not enforced gives a warning, and an enforced component gives an error. The constructor takes plain DesignSystemComponent values, so a project lists its components in gamache.php with no extra service.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
